    {
      "name": "about",
      "displayName": "About the data",
      "layout": [
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "t_about",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "## About this data",
                "- **Sources:** BLS Major Sector Productivity and Costs (`download.bls.gov/pub/time.series/pr/`); US population from the Census ACS 1-year estimates via the DataUSA API.",
                "- **Refresh:** a daily job checks both sources and only reprocesses when something actually changed.",
                "- **Quality checks:** every load validates file structure and key fields; results are cross-checked in two independent ways.",
                "- **Reading the numbers:** many BLS series are *% changes* or *indexes*, so a series' 'total' is only meaningful within that series, never across series.",
                "- **Owner / questions:** Data Quest pipeline (`workspace.data_quest`)."
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 6,
            "height": 6
          }
        }
